  "description": "MCP server that lets Claude, Codex, Cursor, Copilot Studio and other AI agents edit existing Word, PowerPoint and Excel files and fill company templates without breaking their formatting. The agent previews a typed plan, nothing is written when a check fails, and Word edits can be saved as real tracked changes. Works over stdio or HTTP with local folders, SharePoint, iManage Work, Google Drive, Box, Azure Blob Storage and Amazon S3.",
